# ===== CLIENT PROPERTY (unused photos/videos, not part of the site) =====
# atm-property/ holds original and AI-generated images/videos the client
# sent or we created that aren't used anywhere on the live site. They stay
# out of the repo entirely (not just the deploy) since it's his property,
# not site content — hand it off separately (zip/Drive/email) rather than
# tracking it here. Already excluded by the top-level "*" rule above; this
# comment just documents why, so no one adds a "!atm-property/*" rule later.

# ===== PUBLIC ASSETS =====
# Images are tracked; videos are not (too large — host externally)
